This is blinc_app 0.6.0 from https://github.com/project-blinc/Blinc (Apache-2.0, see LICENSE) with one change,
marked "FreeSynergy fix" in src/context/compositor.rs: the compositor sizes its static layer from the surface
texture instead of the window size, which fixes a crash when a window is enlarged
(wgpu validation error "Copy of X 0..1278 would end up overrunning the bounds of the Destination texture of X size 1276").
It is meant to be replaced by upstream once the same fix is released there.
